          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಸಾಧ್ಯವಿಲ್ಲ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಧ್ಯವಿಲ್ಲ (sādhyavilla) — \"it's not possible\", from ಸಾಧ್ಯ (sādhya), \"possible\", with ‑ಇಲ್ಲ, \"not\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಾಧ್ಯವಿಲ್ಲ (sādhyavilla) is sādhya, \"possible\", from Sanskrit sādhya, \"to be accomplished\", with native illa, \"is not\" (DEDR 2559)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Possible, and the no that closes it."
            }
          ]
        },
