              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಾಗಲ್ಲ (hāgalla) — \"it's not like that\", \"no, that's not it\". It is ಹಾಗೆ (hāge), \"like that\", with ಅಲ್ಲ (alla), \"is not\"."
