          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಖಚಿತವಾಗಿ (khacitavāgi) is khacita, \"certain, fixed\", from Sanskrit khacita, \"inlaid, set\", with the adverb ending -āgi, \"in a … way\". What is set in place is certain."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
